# Frontend environment. Copy to `.env.local`.
#
# Base URL of the FastAPI backend. In production set this to the Railway/Render
# URL (e.g. https://balkan-fleet-api.up.railway.app) — a remote host is always
# used exactly as written.
#
# A *loopback* value like the dev default below means "follow the host this page
# was served from": lib/api.ts swaps in window.location.hostname whenever the
# page is opened from a LAN address. That is what lets one running server answer
# localhost and http://<lan-ip>:3000 at the same time, so you do NOT need to edit
# this file (or rebuild) to run on the local network — see README "Run it".
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE=http://127.0.0.1:8001
